      "cooked": "<p>While there’s no shortage of memes that enterprising fans have altered to include Sentinels peeps, every once in a blue moon I come across a meme that makes me think of Sentinels as-is, so I figured why not just make a thread to share when I–or others–come across them?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/82f4ef66e4cc87aa282a05d784fccf9a21f39a64.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/82f4ef66e4cc87aa282a05d784fccf9a21f39a64\" title=\"Just AZ Things\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/82f4ef66e4cc87aa282a05d784fccf9a21f39a64_2_378x375.jpeg\" alt=\"Just AZ Things\" data-base62-sha1=\"iGuQdU0lN9ibF39V2TOGbrvRTZq\" width=\"378\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/82f4ef66e4cc87aa282a05d784fccf9a21f39a64_2_378x375.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/82f4ef66e4cc87aa282a05d784fccf9a21f39a64_2_567x562.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/82f4ef66e4cc87aa282a05d784fccf9a21f39a64_2_756x750.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/82f4ef66e4cc87aa282a05d784fccf9a21f39a64_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Just AZ Things</span><span class=\"informations\">1718×1699 120 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/45ff368a27e6c6beb4b265d5336364233be163d8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/upload