      "created_at": "2024-08-16T00:49:03.630Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So there’s a D&amp;D content creator that got a bunch of well-known geek celebrity figures to help them out by creating D&amp;D “helpers” that could be invoked in their campaign.</p>\n<p>And I feel like Sam Lake’s (of Remedy Entertainment) Finnish prince with a magical drum vibes somehow with somewhere in Sentinels. <a href=\"https://youtu.be/dj1AmKVn-bA?t=143\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://youtu.be/dj1AmKVn-bA?t=143</a></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/998439416d68d4f198c2b79e7ad894281f5e34c3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/998439416d68d4f198c2b79e7ad894281f5e34c3\" title=\"Prince Bell and his magic drum\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/998439416d68d4f198c2b79e7ad894281f5e34c3_2_401x500.png\" alt=\"Prince Bell and his magic drum\" data-base62-sha1=\"lU4l8eC2InzpHw7Wk9UFQYTh3bB\" width=\"401\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/998439416d68d4f198c2b79e7ad894281f5e34c3_2_401x500.png, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/998439416d68d4f198c2b79e7ad894281f5e34c3.png 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/998439416d68d4f198c2b79e7ad894281f5e34c3.png 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/998439416d68d4f198c2b79e7ad894281f5e34c3_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Prince Bell and his magic drum</span><span class=\"informations\">459×571 274 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
