      "created_at": "2024-10-25T14:45:38.724Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/395bdae689c3cb1f4ee3588d999dd679a92f0850.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/395bdae689c3cb1f4ee3588d999dd679a92f0850\" title=\"1007125908\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/395bdae689c3cb1f4ee3588d999dd679a92f0850_2_690x334.jpeg\" alt=\"1007125908\" data-base62-sha1=\"8bq0Tq3TE8oOfWTbjpmlHLbcWrK\" width=\"690\" height=\"334\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/395bdae689c3cb1f4ee3588d999dd679a92f0850_2_690x334.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/395bdae689c3cb1f4ee3588d999dd679a92f0850.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/395bdae689c3cb1f4ee3588d999dd679a92f0850.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/395bdae689c3cb1f4ee3588d999dd679a92f0850_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">1007125908</span><span class=\"informations\">750×364 29.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nDefinitely Absolute Zero’s mentality.</p>\n<p>Speaking of AZ and memes, a while back I was seeing memes posted on social media, thought to myself, “You know, the Wojak guy is totally just AZ in meme form isn’t he” and now I can’t unthink it/unsee it and this annoys me deeply.</p>",
