    {
      "id": 263101,
      "name": "Jeysie",
      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-04-25T17:55:09.648Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, in an attempt at keeping some light-heartedness going…</p>\n<p>Stopping in to say that after seeing people play Clair Obscur, I now want to headcanon the Void spirits in the Argent Artist’s universe looking like</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\nspoilers</summary>\n<p>the paintbrush people</p>\n</details>\n<p>from the game. And with the exact same sorts of personalities, too.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-04-25T17:55:09.648Z",
